History for RHFT map editor:

V1.00 : Buggy first version.  I created all of the original maps using it.

V1.00 - 1.02 : I realised I couldn't unleash the old version on people, so I
        upgraded the code a bit:
                   - Works in all graphics modes (not just 256 colours)
                   - Doesn't mind mode changes now
                   - Doesn't just crash out when there is an error
                   - Refined graphics
                   - Faster window redrawing

